## Children's ward

::bg{location="childrensWard" time="night"}
::vfx{type="flicker"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Twelve iron cribs. Eleven have mattresses. The twelfth has a music box sitting where the pillow should be, lid open, the little dancer bent flat.
@narrator{code="0020"}: Crayon drawings cover the lower half of the walls, exactly as high as a child can reach. One is newer than the others.
@child{code="0010" os}: Are you the new nurse?
<branch id="answer" prompt="The voice is behind the twelfth crib.">
  <choice id="yes" text="&quot;Yes.&quot;">
    @nell{code="0010"}: Yes. I'm the new nurse.
    @child{code="0020" os}: Then you have to do the round. At three. Everybody has to be in bed at three.
  </choice>
  <choice id="no" text="&quot;No. Who's there?&quot;">
    @nell{code="0020"}: No. Who's there? Come out, I won't...
    @child{code="0030" os}: Shh. He counts the beds.
    ::fright
  </choice>
  <choice id="silent" text="Say nothing">
    @narrator{code="0030"}: You hold your breath. After a while the crib creaks, as if someone small had got down off it.
  </choice>
</branch>
@narrator{code="0040"}: There is nobody behind the twelfth crib. There is a dent in the dust the size of a knee.
